{"speciesId":537,"names":{"fr":"Crapustule","es":"Seismitoad","en":"Seismitoad","ja":"ガマゲロゲ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il fait gicler un liquide paralysant des pustules sur sa tête, et attaque ses ennemis à coups de vibrations."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"They shoot paralyzing liquid from their head bumps. They use vibration to hurt their opponents."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Son coup de poing est plus fort quand il fait vibrer la pustule dessus. Il peut briser un gros rocher d’un coup."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It increases the power of its punches by vibrating the bumps on its fists. It can turn a boulder to rubble with one punch."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"By putting power into its bumps, it creates vibrations and increases the power of its punches."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"By putting power into its bumps, it creates vibrations and increases the power of its punches."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Son coup de poing est plus fort quand il fait vibrer la pustule dessus. Il peut briser un gros rocher d’un coup."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Aumenta la potencia de sus puñetazos haciendo vibrar sus puños. Es capaz de quebrar una roca de un solo golpe."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It increases the power of its punches by vibrating the bumps on its fists. It can turn a boulder to rubble with one punch."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"こぶしの コブを 振動させると パンチの 威力が 倍増する。 一撃で 大岩を 粉砕。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il fait gicler un liquide paralysant des pustules sur sa tête, et attaque ses ennemis à coups de vibrations."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Despide un líquido paralizador por los bultos de su cabeza. Atormenta a sus oponentes con enormes vibraciones."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"They shoot paralyzing liquid from their head bumps. They use vibration to hurt their opponents."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"頭の コブから 神経を マヒさせる 液体を 飛ばす。 振動で 相手を 苦しめる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Son coup de poing est plus fort quand il fait vibrer la pustule dessus. Il peut briser un gros rocher d’un coup."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Aumenta la potencia de sus puñetazos haciendo vibrar sus puños. Es capaz de quebrar una roca de un solo golpe."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It increases the power of its punches by vibrating the bumps on its fists. It can turn a boulder to rubble with one punch."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"こぶしの コブを 振動させると パンチの 威力が 倍増する。 一撃で 大岩を 粉砕。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il fait gicler un liquide paralysant des pustules sur sa tête, et attaque ses ennemis à coups de vibrations."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Despide un líquido paralizador por los bultos de su cabeza. Atormenta a sus oponentes con enormes vibraciones."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"They shoot paralyzing liquid from their head bumps. They use vibration to hurt their opponents."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"頭の コブから 神経を マヒさせる 液体を 飛ばす。 振動で 相手を 苦しめる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"En faisant vibrer tous les pustules de son corps, il peut provoquer des secousses similaires à celles d’un séisme. Il est proche des Cradopaud."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Cuando hace vibrar los bultos de su cuerpo, provoca sacudidas que parecen terremotos. Está emparentado con los Croagunk."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"The vibrating of the bumps all over its body causes earthquake-like tremors. Seismitoad and Croagunk are similar species."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"全身の コブを 震わせて 地震のような 揺れを 起こす。 グレッグルと 近い 種類。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ce Pokémon est un excellent masseur grâce aux vibrations de ses pustules. Les personnes âgées